      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-carlisle-indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Indiana Enterprise Center, a mega-sized industrial park in New Carlisle, was featured in the 2020 documentary 'Prime Farmland'.",
